# Centred cell: cathode | electrolyte | ANODE (centre) | electrolyte | cathode
# cathode_center 0.0 -> the S8 slab wraps both z faces (periodic band)
latticeConstant 4.0
nx 10
ny 10
nz 30
anode_center 0.5
anode_thickness_A 20.2
anode_thickness_is_fraction false
anode_species Li
cathode_enabled true
cathode_species S8
cathode_center 0.0
cathode_thickness 0.12
cathode_charge 0
cathode_access_fraction 1.0
write_poscar false
# ---- dynamic passivation by the CEI film (milestone 2) ---------------------
# [SF26]: the sulfite/thiosulfate/LiF film is electronically insulating and
# passivates the cathode. Film sites occupy the electrolyte (OC/BA) shell of a
# cathode site, which holds 18 to 22 of its 26 neighbours. nmin 10 = a cathode
# site is blocked once about half of its electrolyte-facing shell is film
# (geometric threshold, PLACEHOLDER; no literature value exists for a lattice
# criterion). Li16S8 (= Li2S, wide-gap insulator) and Li8S8 (= Li2S2) block as in the
# original point 3; the CEI film species block per [SF26].
cathode_passivating_species Li16S8,Li8S8,CEI_SOx,CEI_org
cathode_passivation_nmin 10
